OL,3,GNEWSANew homes for swifts installed
OL,4,Aacross town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA network of swift boxes has been
OL,7,Fcreated across a town in Derbyshire to
OL,8,Fgive the under-threat birds new homes.
OL,10,FFive neighbourhoods in Chesterfield had
OL,11,F70 such boxes installed high up on
OL,12,Fhomes to give the migratory birds
OL,13,Fspaces to nest when they return in May
OL,14,Fafter wintering in central Africa.
OL,16,FDerbyshire Wildlife Trust, which
OL,17,Finstalled the boxes as part of its
OL,18,FWilder Chesterfield project, said
OL,19,Fswifts look to use the same nest sites
OL,20,Ffor life but building renovations and
OL,21,Frepairs can mean these nooks can
OL,22,Fdisappear.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
