OL,3,GNEWSANew homes for swifts installed
OL,4,Aacross town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA loss of nest sites, coupled with
OL,7,Fdeclining insect numbers and the loss
OL,8,Fof green spaces, has led to a 66% fall
OL,9,Fin numbers, said the Wilder Connections
OL,10,Fofficer Mark Newton.
